  {
   "utility": "CAISO (PG&E, SCE, SDG&E)",
   "state": "CA",
   "rule_name": "Rotating outages of 14 and 15 August 2020: load shed by utility, event totals with start and finish (no hourly values)",
   "affects": "caiso_heat_2020",
   "source_url": "https://www.caiso.com/Documents/Final-Root-Cause-Analysis-Mid-August-2020-Extreme-Heat-Wave.pdf",
   "source_title": "CAISO, CPUC and CEC, Final Root Cause Analysis, Mid-August 2020 Extreme Heat Wave (January 13, 2021)",
   "what": "14 August: CAISO-initiated 931.6 MW (SCE 400, PG&E 460, SDG&E 71.6), IOU actual response 1,072 MW (400, 588, 84); Stage 3 at 6:38 p.m., two phases of 500 MW, restoring from 7:40 p.m.; SCE 6:56 to 7:59 PM, PG&E 6:38 to ~9:08 PM. 15 August: CAISO-initiated 465.8 MW (200, 230, 35.8), actual 698 MW (200, 459, 39); about 500 MW ordered at 6:28 p.m. Stage 3, restored at 6:48 p.m., 20 minutes; SCE 6:43 to 6:51 PM, PG&E 6:25 to ~7:55 PM. CPUC-jurisdictional utilities only; times Pacific (PDT).",
   "cites": [
    {
     "page": "40",
     "section": "3.3.2 August 14",
     "quote": "At 6:38 p.m., the CAISO declared a Stage 3 Emergency because it was deficient in meeting its reserve requirement."
    },
    {
     "page": "40",
     "section": "3.3.2 August 14",
     "quote": "the CAISO ordered two phases of controlled load shed of 500 MW each, based on a pro-rata share across the CAISO footprint for distribution utility companies."
    },
    {
     "page": "41",
     "section": "3.3.2 August 14",
     "quote": "By 7:40 p.m., the CAISO began restoring previously shed load as system conditions had improved"
    },
    {
     "page": "42",
     "section": "3.3.3 August 15",
     "quote": "At 6:28 p.m., the CAISO declared a Stage 3 Emergency because it was deficient in meeting its reserves requirement."
    },
    {
     "page": "43",
     "section": "3.3.3 August 15",
     "quote": "the CAISO ordered the distribution utility operators to execute about 500 MW of controlled load shed on their respective distribution systems."
    },
    {
     "page": "43",
     "section": "3.3.3 August 15",
     "quote": "At 6:48 p.m., the Stage 3 Emergency was cancelled because wind production had increased more than 500 MW and the CAISO ordered all previously shed load to be restored. The duration of the controlled load shed was 20 minutes."
    },
    {
     "page": "47",
     "section": "3.4",
     "quote": "Neither the agencies nor the CAISO has visibility into the number of customers, amount of load shed, or duration for non-CPUC jurisdictional entities."
    },
